flowchart TD
  subgraph Client Tier
    Scanner[Scanner Mobile App / PWA]
  end

  subgraph Edge & Security
    GW[API Gateway & Auth Guard]
  end

  subgraph Application Tier
    QR[QR Resolver Service]
    Orch[Icebreaker Orchestrator]
    ProfSvc[Profile & Privacy Service]
  end

  subgraph Storage & Cache
    Redis[(Redis Cache & Nonces)]
    PG[(PostgreSQL Profile Store)]
    VDB[(Vector Database)]
  end

  subgraph AI & Analytics
    LLM[LLM Inference API]
    Queue[Telemetry Queue - Kafka/SQS]
  end

  Scanner -->|POST /scan| GW
  GW -->|Validate Token| QR
  QR -->|Check Nonce| Redis
  GW -->|Trigger Pipeline| Orch
  Orch -->|Lookup Cache| Redis
  Orch -->|Get Paired Profiles| ProfSvc
  ProfSvc -->|Read Profiles| PG
  Orch -->|Semantic Match| VDB
  Orch -->|Generate Starters| LLM
  LLM -->|Return Prompts| Orch
  Orch -->|Cache Results| Redis
  Orch -->|Publish Telemetry| Queue
  Orch -->|Starters Payload| GW
  GW -->|Render Starters| Scanner